+Beat my track / Premium Collection 01
+Original vector livery artwork authored for this project on 2026-11-15.
+Lettering outlined from repository Barlow Condensed SemiBold, SIL OFL 1.1; see ../../fonts/OFL.txt.
+All names, insignia and race-team graphics are original fictional design elements.
